@startuml synthetic-generation-swimlane
title WS8: Synthetic Generation - Module Swimlane\nv1.0 | February 2026

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #BBBBBB
}

|Configuration|
start
:Load generation config\n(DPI tier, color mode,\naugmentation profile);
note right
  **Source**: src/.../synthetic/config.py
  **LOC**: ~300
  7 DPI tiers: 72/100/150/200/300/400/600
  ColorMode: COLOR(60%), GRAYSCALE(30%), BINARIZED(10%)
  Pydantic v2 config models
end note
:Select scripts and fonts\n(30+ ISO 15924 scripts);
:Determine composition\n(text blocks, spacing,\nmargins, columns);

|Text Rendering|
:Render multi-script text blocks\n(PIL/Pillow text drawing);
:Apply font-specific adjustments\n(size, kerning, line height);
:Compose page layout\n(single/multi-column,\nheaders, footers);
note right
  **Source**: src/.../synthetic/generator.py
  **LOC**: ~400
  MultiScriptDocumentGenerator class
  _render_text_blocks() method
end note

|Geometric Transforms|
:Apply orientation rotation\n(0, 90, 180, or 270 degrees);
:Apply skew transform\n(random within +/-10 degrees);
note right
  **CRITICAL**: Applied BEFORE augmentation
  _apply_geometric_transforms() method
  Operates on clean rendered image
  (Bug fix: was previously post-augmentation)
end note

|Augmentation Pipeline|
:Select document age profile;
if (Random draw) then (80% MODERN)
  :No aging effects applied;
else if (15% AGED)
  :Apply yellowing tint\n(sepia color shift);
  :Apply foxing spots\n(random brown patches);
  :Apply ink fading\n(contrast reduction 10-20%);
else (5% HISTORICAL)
  :Apply heavy yellowing;
  :Apply dense foxing;
  :Apply severe ink fading\n(contrast reduction 30-50%);
  :Apply edge degradation;
endif
note right
  **Source**: src/.../synthetic/augmentation_hybrid.py
  **LOC**: ~350
  HybridAugmenter class
  AGED/HISTORICAL profiles use
  Albumentations transforms
end note

|Measurement|
:Measure character height\n(_measure_char_height method);
:Validate DPI against\nsafety rails (150-600);
:Compute resolution quality\nscore from char_height\n(optimal: 32-48px);

|Schema Adaptation|
:Build multi-task metadata\n(nested under metadata.data.multi_task);
:Compute IQA vector\n(45-dim from degradation params);
:Set Tier 0 confidence\n(all fields = 1.0);
:Record generation provenance\n(config hash, timestamp, seed);
note right
  **Source**: src/.../synthetic/schema_adapter.py
  **LOC**: ~200
  Fields populated:
  - CaptureMethodInfo (3 fields)
  - ResolutionInfo (6 fields)
  - QualityInfo + MLImageQualityInfo (10)
  - LanguageInfo + ContentFlags (16)
  - GeometricInfo (7 fields)
  - ImagePropertiesInfo (2 fields)
  - TextScopeInfo (5 fields)
  - PaperSizeInfo (5 fields)
  - CodeDetection (4 fields)
end note

|Output|
:Write to partitioned parquet\n(dataset_name=synth-multiscript/);
:Write JSON with full detail;
:Update generation manifest\n(sample count, config hash);
note right
  **CLI**: src/.../synthetic/cli.py (~150 LOC)
  imgprep synth generate
  --color-mode, --skew, --orientation
  --augmenter hybrid
end note
note right
  **WS8 Synthetic Generation Pipeline**
  Total: ~1,400 LOC across 5 source files
  Target: 250K multi-script documents
  All labels at Tier 0 confidence (exact by construction)
  Downstream: WS3 data prep, WS2 model training
end note
stop

@enduml
